0.01
    Add configured-NV error functions and inverses, normal CDF/survival
    functions and two-sided sigma/probability conversions with stable tails.
    Probe the selected math symbols without narrowing wider NV formats.
    Add basic bootstrap intervals and intervals from supplied distributions.
    Keep bootstrap statistics packed through native bounds calculation,
    use selection for bootstrap medians and validate U32 RNG streams.
    Add harmonic and geometric means, adjusted and unadjusted shape
    statistics, regression diagnostics and implicit-index linear trends.
    Reject unresolved signed harmonic cancellation and report checked IQR
    overflow and MAD intermediate range limits with structured conditions.
    Add caller-directed outlier filtering with exact candidate selection
    and independent callback snapshots.
    Add ordinary and weighted exponential smoothing with exact per-step
    arithmetic and explicit current-observation coefficients.
    Add explicit and equal-width histograms with exact generated edges,
    boundary closure options and outside counts.  Add structured summaries
    with independent availability reasons and one shared quartile sort.
    Detect range and spread overflow under directed hardware rounding and
    report invalid moment state as an internal numerical condition.
    Add explicit ranks, empirical quantiles, exact linear quantiles, trimmed
    means and all tied modes. Use exact midpoints in bootstrap medians and
    MAD. Report selection and trimming argument errors as module conditions.
    Add exact sum of squares with final nearest-even rounding, lazy stored
    results and a bounded incremental accumulator.
    Compute paired products and cancellation exactly. Round covariance,
    correlation and regression coefficients independently to nearest-even.
    Add observation copies, sorted copies, clear, range and first extrema
    positions. Preserve positions across batch additions and merges.
    Round compensated arithmetic at each required NV step on x87 builds.
    Accumulate exact sums of converted observations and round sum and mean
    once. Allow overflowing sums to recover through later cancellation.
    Reject incomplete option lists and unsupported bootstrap statistics.
    Preserve cancellation remainders, scaled moments and regression product
    residuals. Fix subnormal interpolation and reject lost paired terms.
    Add native stored and incremental statistics, order statistics,
    case resampling, bootstrap percentile intervals, and paired statistics.
